      "source": "`maxFrames`: The maximum number of sample frames that can be requested of a processing tap at any one time. Typically this will be approximately 50 msec of audio (2048 samples @ 44.1kHz).",
      "normalizedSource": "`maxFrames`: The maximum number of sample frames that can be requested of a processing tap at any one time. Typically this will be approximately 50 msec of audio (2048 samples @ 44.1kHz).",
